cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the open dataset of EU Legislative Intelligence, please cite it as below, with the release you used
  (tags data-YYYY-MM-DD). The code that builds it is under the MIT License (LICENSE).
type: dataset
title: "EU Legislative Intelligence – open dataset"
abstract: >-
  Legislative files of the European Union with their status and dates, the acts adopted in them, European Parliament
  and Council votes, the transposition of directives by Member State with the national measures notified,
  infringement cases, and a crosswalk of the official identifiers that join them (procedure reference, CELEX, ELI,
  Parliament vote, Council voting result and document, national measure, infringement case). Built only from
  official EU records (European Parliament, EUR-Lex, Council of the EU, European Commission) and released weekly as
  CSV tables with a Frictionless Data Package descriptor. Independent and not official.
authors:
  - name: RAHV-FB
    website: "https://github.com/RAHV-FB"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://rahv-fb.github.io/eu-intel/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RAHV-FB/eu-intel"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/RAHV-FB/eu-intel/releases"
keywords:
  - European Union
  - legislation
  - European Parliament
  - Council of the European Union
  - EUR-Lex
  - votes
  - transposition
  - infringements
  - open data
